Vehicle stop. ➡️USBP K-9 Alert.➡️ Agents searched. ➡️COCAINE SEIZED❗
Agents working highway operations on I-5 near Oceanside, CA, pulled over a sedan carrying much more than luggage in the trunk—50 tightly wrapped packages of cocaine, totaling more than 129 pounds. The driver, a legal permanent resident, was taken into custody and faces federal drug charges.

