NO MAN’S LAND APPREHENSION

Agents from Ajo Station demonstrated exceptional skill and teamwork, successfully locating and apprehending 15 illegal aliens attempting to evade detection in the rugged Sonoran Desert. Despite efforts to blend in with camouflage, agents leveraged Horse Patrol, ATVs, and advanced tracking techniques to secure our border while overcoming challenging conditions. U.S. Border Patrol agents remain mission-focused on countering cartel tactics and protecting our nation’s front lines.

@USBPChiefTCA

